{"id": "zh-70147afc-0031", "text": "上线之前必须先等待连接池排空，否则旧 worker 会继续使用过期的表结构。等三十秒，然后按原计划做切换就可以，一切照旧。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 59, "topic_id": "zh-wait-pool-drain", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等待", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0032", "text": "基准测试更偏向向量化路径。不过这里也有一个标量回退实现，更容易调试，而且在小输入上几乎一样快，所以不必强求。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 54, "topic_id": "zh-however-benchmark", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "不过", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0033", "text": "这份路线图很激进，但依然现实，因为团队之前已经交付过两次完全相同的功能，依赖项也早就准备好了，没有别的风险。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 54, "topic_id": "zh-but-roadmap", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0034", "text": "第一步抓取失败的请求，第二步拿它回放到预发构建，第三步对比两份日志。如果回放仍然通过，那问题就是环境造成的，而不是代码里的缺陷。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 64, "topic_id": "zh-first-second-third", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0035", "text": "队列、主题、分区、消费者组等是基本的构建块。你把它们拼成一个拓扑，代理会替你处理投递保证，不需要自己实现重试逻辑。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 57, "topic_id": "zh-deng-summary", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0036", "text": "其实这个结构一旦构建完成就是不可变的，所以读者永远不需要加锁。写者会创建一份新副本，并在完成后原子地换掉根指针。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "coding", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 56, "topic_id": "zh-qishi-immutable", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "其实", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0037", "text": "这个缓存命中率在纸面上很健康，而且在负载下也站得住脚，所以在下一个发布周期之前我看不出有修改淘汰策略的必要。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "analysis", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 54, "topic_id": "zh-hedge-one-side", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0038", "text": "迁移顺序很灵活，但估算几乎不变，所以我们可以从任一服务开始，仍然能在同一个两周窗口内按原计划完成全部工作。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "planning", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 53, "topic_id": "zh-but-preference", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "但", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0039", "text": "我们会先等待健康检查超时，然后再把节点标记为不健康。这个宽限期是刻意设置的，可以防止在缓慢重启期间反复抖动。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "debugging", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 54, "topic_id": "zh-wait-timeout", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": "等待", "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
{"id": "zh-70147afc-0040", "text": "不管我们给这个模块起什么名字，依赖图都保持不变。重命名只涉及导入行，对调用者来说运行时行为完全不会改变。 这个改动很小，回滚只需要一条命令，所以完全不必赶时间。", "has_turn": false, "first_turn_pos": -1, "scenario": "teaching", "turn_type": "none", "is_negative": true, "lang": "zh", "word_count": 79, "topic_id": "zh-however-name", "source_model": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "peer_session": "70147afc-5d29-417b-86a6-0982c251b6af", "provenance": "generated", "conjunction": null, "verified_by": [], "verdict": "pending"}
